<title>JAPAN: Nippon Paper rises on group firm merger reports.</title>
<headline>Nippon Paper rises on group firm merger reports.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Nippon Paper Industries Co Ltd rose in early Friday morning trade, inspired by newspaper reports that two of its group firms had agreed to merge, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0032 GMT, the shares were up 18 yen at 540 yen.</p>
